 ],
 "decisions": [
  "Unit-viewer rows (S01129-S01200): the full-width space between model number and name becomes one ASCII space; model numbers kept exactly as the game writes them.",
  "Where the source abbreviates a unit name (F91, Ez8, Full Burnern, Dendrobium), the abbreviation is kept rather than expanded.",
  "'X-senyou' custom units written 'Name (Pilot)' following glossary entries such as 'Jagd Doga (Quess)'.",
  "MA-form variants use glossary 'MA mode' in parentheses.",
  "gt/io/cd prefixes are developer list labels; kept in place as ui_01 did."
 ],
 "uncertain": [
  "S01077, S01179, S01251: Z Zaku is marked unverified in the glossary; used 'Z Zaku'.",
  "S01083: Japanese literally 'Qubeley mkII (mass-production)'; translated literally rather than the card/viewer name 'Qubeley Mass Production Type' (S01178, S01250).",
  "S01169, S01241: renpougun written 'Federation Forces' per glossary; full glossary has 'Hizack (E.F.S.F.)' for the related variant - orchestrator may unify.",
  "S01096, S01098: 'kuro karaa' rendered '(Black)'; could also be '(Black Vanguard)' if these are the same units as S01196.",
  "S01218: card label says 'Zaku Kai'; wrote glossary 'Zaku II FZ'.",
  "S01123/S01124/S01125: viewer controls read as Pan / Reset (initial view); not seen on screen.",
  "S01201-S01272: unsure whether players see the 'cd' list; prefix kept, space added after card number."
 ]
}